      "title": "Equinix to Post Q3 Earnings: What's in Store for the Stock?",
      "summary": "Equinix (EQIX) is set to report Q3 2026 earnings on October 28, with consensus estimates projecting 11% revenue growth to $2.57 billion and 6.9% AFFO per share growth to $10.51. Strong demand for interconnected data center infrastructure driven by AI adoption and cloud expansion is expected to support growth, though high interest expenses may be a headwind. The company's quantitative model does not predict a surprise beat this quarter.",
